Subject: [PATCH 13/14] docs(trace): record why the Trace dialog shows what the
 tracer used (ADR-396)

No change in the app. The decision record explains the Trace dialog
changes in this package: the display-only trace report and how long the
dialog trusts it, Manual starting one level below the automatic
threshold, the band and route shown in automatic detection, the
working-grid note, hints checked against the engine, Edge Detection
previewed as the lines it engraves (ADR-235), named kept adjustments,
Centerline Join gaps, the Smooth and Sharp descriptions and Alt+T. It
also records which texts depend on engine changes from the same audit
batch, and why Multi-File Trace still asks for one file at a time.

